items.title:
org.geolatte:geolatte-geojson-jackson2 2.0.1 发布, Jackson 2 adapter for the geolatte-geojson library. Registers the GeolatteGeomModule with a
        Jackson 2 ObjectMapper. All GeoJSON encoding/decoding logic lives in geolatte-geojson-core;
        this module is a thin adapter over the Jackson 2 streaming and tree-model APIs.

